{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows从压缩包执行Windows脚本。对应需求：执行。官方：Windows Script Execution from Archive。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows从压缩包执行Windows脚本","references":["https://medium.com/walmartglobaltech/smartapesg-4605157a5b80"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"30f9d940-7d55-4fff-a8b9-4715d20eb204","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name : \"wscript.exe\" and\n process.parent.name : (\"explorer.exe\", \"winrar.exe\", \"7zFM.exe\") and\n process.args :\n        (\"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\7z*\\\\*\",\n         \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\*.zip.*\\\\*\",\n         \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\Rar$*\\\\*\",\n         \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\Temp?_*\\\\*\",\n         \"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\BNZ.*\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows从压缩包执行Windows脚本\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.005","name":"Visual Basic","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/005/"},{"id":"T1059.007","name":"JavaScript","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/007/"}]},{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.002","name":"Malicious File","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
